              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uwiteka aramubwira ati “Genda usubize inzira yose y'ubutayu ujye i Damasiko, nugerayo uzimikishe Hazayeli amavuta abe umwami w'i Siriya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.2+2KI.9.3+2KI.9.4+2KI.9.5+2KI.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abami 9.2-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na Yehu mwene Nimushi na we uzamwimikishe amavuta abe umwami w'Abisirayeli, kandi na Elisa mwene Shafati wo muri Abeli Mehola, uzamusukeho amavuta abe umuhanuzi mu cyimbo cyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko uzaba yarokotse inkota ya Hazayeli, Yehu azamwica, uzarokoka iya Yehu, Elisa azamwica. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 11.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko rero nzaba nsigaranye abantu ibihumbi birindwi muri Isirayeli batapfukamiye Bāli, ntibamusome.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya na Elisa basezerana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
