        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko avayo, aragenda asanga Elisa mwene Shafati, ahingisha inka zizirikanijwe ebyiri ebyiri mu mirongo cumi n'ibiri, ahagaze ku murongo uheruka. Eliya akebereza aho aramusanga, amunagira umwitero we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
